            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Torrid 0.1.4</h2>
<p>Fixes:</p>
<ul>
  <li>BitTorrent: After removing a finished torrent, adding the same torrent again no longer fails with “already in the list”.</li>
  <li>Task list: a magnet link that is still fetching its info now shows a generic file icon instead of a folder.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Torrid 0.1.4 (简体中文)</h2>
<p>修复：</p>
<ul>
  <li>BT：移除已完成的种子后，再添加同一个种子不再提示“已经在下载列表里”。</li>
  <li>任务列表：磁力链接还在获取种子信息时，显示通用文件图标，不再显示文件夹。</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
